# L5R 5E - CELESTIAL REALMS: NON-PLAYER CHARACTERS (NPCs)
# NPCs from Chapter 2 (The Soul of the Empire). Source: Celestial Realms.

EXTENSION "L5R5e_CelestialRealms_NPCs" {
    VERSION "0.5.2"
    SPEC_VERSION "0.5"
    RELEASE_DATE "2026-09-02"
    DEPENDS_ON "L5R5e_Core_Core"

    # source stat block (page 39)
    ^"Akodo Tadeo, Inspired Zealot" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t4540de6f35155c46f41f0 ^"NPC"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" STRING "Adversary" FIXED
            ^"Combat Conflict Rank" INTEGER 6
            ^"Intrigue Conflict Rank" INTEGER 6
            ^"Rings" DEF {
                ^"Air" INTEGER 2
                ^"Earth" INTEGER 3
                ^"Fire" INTEGER 4
                ^"Water" INTEGER 4
                ^"Void" INTEGER 3
            }
            ^"Demeanor" STRING "Devoted"
            ^"Social Skill Check TN Modifiers" STRING "Fire +2, Earth -2"
            ^"Endurance" INTEGER 14
            ^"Composure" INTEGER 16
            ^"Focus" INTEGER 5
            ^"Vigilance" INTEGER 3
            ^"Honor" INTEGER 80
            ^"Glory" INTEGER 65
            ^"Status" INTEGER 45
            ^"Skills" LIST OF STRING ["Artisan 2", "Martial 3", "Scholar 4", "Social 3", "Trade 1"]
            ^"Advantages" LIST OF STRING ["Tactical Prowess (Fire) [Martial; Mental]"]
            ^"Disadvantages" LIST OF STRING ["Intolerant (Air) [Social; Interpersonal]"]
            ^"Favored Weapons" LIST OF STRING ["Katana: Range 1, Damage 4, Deadliness 5/7, Ceremonial, Razor-Edged"]
            ^"Gear" LIST OF STRING ["Wakizashi", "ceremonial clothes (Physical 1, Ceremonial, Resplendent)", "personal chop"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Akodo Tadeo maintains a remarkable claim—that the Kami Hantei appeared to him, telling him that his duty to the Empire was complete, and that his reward would be elevation to the Celestial Heavens. His family connections to the Seppun have earned him access to the Shrine to Hantei-no-Kami, where he has made offerings and prayed several times. As yet, however, the Kami has not returned to him. While Tadeo's claim seems outlandish, a fire of fierce conviction burns in his eyes; clearly, he fervently believes that what he is saying is true. His Seppun patrons weary of him, though, and he will soon have to leave the Forbidden City. Tadeo's response is that he can now answer only to the Kami Hantei himself and will remain until the Kami comes to take him to Tengoku."
        RULES {
            #L5RCELcel01akodotadeoZzZzZz: devoted_sermon "Devoted Sermon: Activation: As a Support action, Akodo Tadeo may make a TN 3 Theology (Fire) check targeting all characters in the scene who can hear him (including himself). If he succeeds, he may choose to either cause every target to receive 2 strife or cause every target to remove 2 strife."
        }
    }

    # source stat block (page 77)
    ^"Moshi Chiasa, Centipede Clan Champion" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t4540de6f35155c46f41f0 ^"NPC"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" STRING "Adversary" FIXED
            ^"Combat Conflict Rank" INTEGER 8
            ^"Intrigue Conflict Rank" INTEGER 5
            ^"Rings" DEF {
                ^"Air" INTEGER 2
                ^"Earth" INTEGER 3
                ^"Fire" INTEGER 5
                ^"Water" INTEGER 2
                ^"Void" INTEGER 3
            }
            ^"Demeanor" STRING "Idealistic"
            ^"Social Skill Check TN Modifiers" STRING "Water +2, Earth -2"
            ^"Endurance" INTEGER 16
            ^"Composure" INTEGER 10
            ^"Focus" INTEGER 7
            ^"Vigilance" INTEGER 2
            ^"Honor" INTEGER 62
            ^"Glory" INTEGER 53
            ^"Status" INTEGER 76
            ^"Skills" LIST OF STRING ["Artisan 2", "Martial 3", "Scholar 4", "Social 2", "Trade 2"]
            ^"Advantages" LIST OF STRING ["Mother's Blessing (Fire) [Scholar, Social; Interpersonal, Mental]", "Local Renown (Water) [Social; Interpersonal]"]
            ^"Disadvantages" LIST OF STRING ["Inexperienced Leader (Air) [Social; Interpersonal, Mental]"]
            ^"Favored Weapons" LIST OF STRING ["Katana: Range 1, Damage 4, Deadliness 5/7, Ceremonial, Razor-Edged", "Righteous Sunlight (Bō): Range 1-2, Damage 4, Deadliness 5, Sacred"]
            ^"Gear" LIST OF STRING ["Tear-blessed robes (Physical 2, Supernatural 4, Ceremonial)", "wakizashi", "personal chop", "various offerings for to Amaterasu and fire kami"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Lady Moshi Chiasa was chosen as clan champion due to her extremely strong bond with Amaterasu. She often traveled to the shrine to speak to the goddess as if she were an old friend. A keen observer may notice that the goddess tends to dote on the young woman like a mother following a child. Chiasa never gets stuck out in the rain, never has her hat pulled from her by a strong gust of wind, and never seems to feel cold outside, even during the winter. Indeed, temperate weather appears to follow her wherever she goes, and she always seems lit by a convenient ray of light. However, Chiasa is young and inexperienced and often feels overwhelmed with the pressures of being clan daimyō, she is staunchly idealistic and hopeful, but she has little real political experience."
        RULES {
            #L5RCELcel02moshichiasaZzZzZz: favored_child_of_the_sun "Favored Child of the Sun: When Chiasa performs an action to activate an invocation, she reduces the TN by 1 (to a minimum of 1).\n\nAdditionally, she knows the following invocations: Amaterasu's Gaze (page 108); Armor of Radiance and Extinguish (page 202 of the core rulebook); and Rise, Flame (page 204 of the core rulebook)."
            #aPd4GXSynZakQSF0TK8UmE: blessing_of_the_centipede "Blessing of the Centipede: When Chiasa performs a check to activate a Fire invocation, she may spend (op) in the following way:\n\nFire (op)+: Select a target affected by the invocation. If that target would suffer damage, they remove that much fatigue instead."
            #tgaSko4Kb3RODOScDitgs7: righteous_sunlight "Righteous Sunlight: When Chiasa performs a successful Attack action check using Righteous Sunlight, she may spend (op) in the following way:\n\nFire (op): The target suffers the Burning condition.\n\nFire (op)+: If the target has the Burning condition, they receive 3 strife for each (op) spent this way."
        }
    }

    # source stat block (page 78)
    ^"Akodo Hinata, Headstrong Adept" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t4540de6f35155c46f41f0 ^"NPC"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Type" STRING "Adversary" FIXED
            ^"Combat Conflict Rank" INTEGER 4
            ^"Intrigue Conflict Rank" INTEGER 5
            ^"Rings" DEF {
                ^"Air" INTEGER 2
                ^"Earth" INTEGER 1
                ^"Fire" INTEGER 4
                ^"Water" INTEGER 2
                ^"Void" INTEGER 1
            }
            ^"Demeanor" STRING "Flighty"
            ^"Social Skill Check TN Modifiers" STRING "Fire +2, Earth -2"
            ^"Endurance" INTEGER 10
            ^"Composure" INTEGER 6
            ^"Focus" INTEGER 6
            ^"Vigilance" INTEGER 2
            ^"Honor" INTEGER 37
            ^"Glory" INTEGER 36
            ^"Status" INTEGER 36
            ^"Skills" LIST OF STRING ["Artisan 1", "Martial 1", "Scholar 2", "Social 2", "Trade 1"]
            ^"Advantages" LIST OF STRING ["Determined Nature (Earth) [Social; Interpersonal, Mental]"]
            ^"Disadvantages" LIST OF STRING ["Youthful Ignorance (Fire) [Social; Interpersonal, Mental]"]
            ^"Favored Weapons" LIST OF STRING ["Katana: Range 1, Damage 4, Deadliness 5/7, Ceremonial, Razor-Edged"]
            ^"Gear" LIST OF STRING ["Traveling clothes (Physical 2, Durable, Mundane, Subtle)", "wakizashi", "journal of incoherent dream-related notes"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Hinata was aware of their family's grudge against the Centipede Clan from the time they were a young child. However, Hinata has recently been plagued with visions in which Amaterasu whispers to them about something terrible Hinata must help stop. The goddess said they must train under the Moshi, but Hinata knew their parents would never allow such a thing. They ran away in the middle of the night and had been trying to steal an enrollment certificate to the Light of the Lady Sun Dōjō when they were apprehended by the Moshi. They hate to disappoint their family, and they despair to think of what they have put their parents through, but Hinata would hate to disappoint the goddess even more.\n\nWhat no one yet realizes, however, is that Hinata has been blessed by Amaterasu with a frightening amount of power. Whether Hinata's dreams are about stopping a terrible event in the making or are an attempt to warn them that they themself are the potential catalyst for disaster is uncertain. If Hinata is forced back into Lion Clan hands, Hinata may accidentally unleash some of their untapped abilities, calling upon the numerous fire kami in the area to devastating effect."
        RULES {
            #L5RCELcel03akodohinataZzZzZz: undeniable_sincerity "Undeniable Sincerity: When Hinata makes a check using a Social or Scholar skill, they reduce the TN of the check by 1 (to a minimum of 1).\n\nAdditionally, when they make a Social or Scholar skill check, they may spend (op) (op) in the following way:\n\n(op) (op): The targets of Hinata's check receive 2 strife if they attempt to discredit Hinata's words or cause Hinata harm. This effect persists until the end of the scene."
            #xlZizzEdrclJpq5vqFSmj5: gift_of_amaterasu "Gift of Amaterasu: Hinata knows the following invocations: Biting Steel, The Fires from Within, and Wall of Fire. These abilities can only be used if Hinata unmasked this scene."
        }
    }

}